# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/sw/dateFields.json.  The week
# field's displayName is wiki and it counts with the same surface in both
# plural categories ("wiki {0} zilizopita") -- class 9/10, invariant.
#
# juma (class 5/6, plural majuma) is the other word for a week and is the
# source of the Juma- weekday names, but no source consulted gives its
# class-5/6 last/this/next agreement forms, so it ships nowhere: wiki already
# carries every week reading CLDR states.
wiki
